      "text": "Ribbon graphs and their invariants derived from quantum groups — The generalization of Jones polynomial of links to the case of graphs in R 3 is presented.\n\n**Ribbon graphs and their invariants derived from quantum groups**\n\n*Ribbon Graphs and Their Invariants Derived*\n\n26 pp, 17 sections.\n\n**Abstract.** The generalization of Jones polynomial of links to the case of graphs in R 3 is presented. It is constructed as the functor from the category of graphs to the category of representations of the quantum group.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 Compact Braided Categories; 3 Quasitriangular and Ribbon Hopf Algebras; 4 Coloured Ribbon Graphs; I vl vl vl; 5 The Main Theorem; 5.3 Lemma. Figure 8 presents a generating set ; 6 Applications and Generalizations of Theorem ; 7 Examples; f V~ ~Va|; R=exp(~H|; Jm~,,~; In]q!; 24 N. Yu. Reshetikhin and V. G. Turaev sional ; 2 [j+m]![j_m]l[jl_ml]l[jz_m2]lUl +j2_j]![2j+ l; References",
